{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/intro.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a handcrafted 2D pixel action-adventure that blends fluid combat with bullet-hell mechanics. Master unique abilities like the teleportation dagger and bullet counter to overcome enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an emotional journey about facing loss and overcoming grief. Explore a handcrafted world filled with secrets to uncover and challenges to face. This enchanting and mysterious world is brought to life with its handcrafted pixel-art and moving soundtracks, delivering an emotional experience that stays with you.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use unique mechanics to traverse and interact with the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/teleportation.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive fast-paced bullet hell challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/Bullet_dash.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore beautiful, hand-crafted landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/Waterfall.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/Activation.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a mysterious journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/cutscene.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself against tough enemies and bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/BossFight.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876290?t=1747812032","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2876290?t=1747812032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/8e184c7ab44ed36b293a237720b970bea2803446/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747812032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/8e184c7ab44ed36b293a237720b970bea2803446/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747812032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3244790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/intro.gif?t=1747812032\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a handcrafted 2D pixel action-adventure that blends fluid combat with bullet-hell mechanics. Master unique abilities like the teleportation dagger and bullet counter to overcome e